1
00:00:06,97 --> 00:00:10,20
She's having my baby, and she's not here yet.
她將生下我的小孩,她卻還沒來

2
00:00:10,41 --> 00:00:13,27
-Has her water broken yet? -I don't know.
-她的羊水破了嗎? -我不知道

3
00:00:13,51 --> 00:00:17,88
When we talked,she said she'd already passed the mucous plug.
她和我通話時說她已分泌粘液

4
00:00:20,02 --> 00:00:22,11
Do we have to know about that?
我們需要知道這一些嗎?

5
00:00:22,68 --> 00:00:25,05
What'll you do when you have a baby?
喬伊,你有小孩時你會怎麼做?

6
00:00:25,25 --> 00:00:28,65
I'll be in the waiting room, handing out cigars.
我會在等待室中送雪茄

7
00:00:28,92 --> 00:00:33,83
Joey's made arrangements to have his baby in a movie from the '50s.
喬伊準備讓他孩子出生在50年代的電影中

8
00:00:34,83 --> 00:00:37,92
She could be giving birth in the cab.
我不敢相信她可能會在計程車中生產

9
00:00:38,13 --> 00:00:41,47
Relax. It's only $2 for the first contraction...
羅斯,冷靜點第一次收縮收費二塊錢

10
00:00:41,77 --> 00:00:45,93
...and then 50 cents for each additional contraction.
之後每收縮一次收五毛錢

11
00:00:46,14 --> 00:00:49,51
What,it's okay when Chandler does it?
什麼?錢德這樣說時就沒事

12
00:00:49,71 --> 00:00:52,37
You have to pick your moments.
你得選對時間

13
00:00:52,88 --> 00:00:54,21
Did I miss it?
我錯過了嗎?

14
00:00:54,42 --> 00:00:57,28
-She's not here yet. -What's with the guitar?
-沒有,她根本還沒出現 -幹嘛帶吉他來?

15
00:00:57,49 --> 00:01:01,55
We might be here for a while. Things might get musical.
我想我們會在這兒待一陣子,來點音樂

16
00:01:02,02 --> 00:01:05,55
-Where have you been? -We stopped at the gift shop.
-你到底上哪兒去了? -我們中途在禮品店待了一會兒

17
00:01:05,83 --> 00:01:08,06
I got this, and Susan wanted a Chunky.
我想買這個,蘇珊想買「矮胖」

18
00:01:08,30 --> 00:01:12,46
You're having a baby. You don't stop for Chunkies.
你就快生小寶寶了. 是小寶寶不能中途下車買矮胖

19
00:01:12,77 --> 00:01:15,60
I used to have that bumper sticker.
我過去也用那個汽車貼紙

20
00:01:16,24 --> 00:01:18,47
You see what I mean?
懂我意思嗎?

21
00:01:19,01 --> 00:01:21,24
The One With the Birth
六人行 第1季 第23集 本出世

22
00:01:22,26 --> 00:01:30,00
-=BT之家DRM小組 http://bbs.btbbt.com=- 榮譽出品 河馬根據網絡字幕微調製作

23
00:02:05,49 --> 00:02:08,89
-"Stopped for a Chunky." -Let it go,Ross.
-下車買矮胖 -別介意了,羅斯

24
00:02:09,09 --> 00:02:11,12
I got an extra one. You want this?
我多了一個,想要嗎?不想

25
00:02:15,13 --> 00:02:18,83
-How's my favorite parenting team? -Dr. Franzblau.
-我最喜愛的父母團隊好 -法大夫

26
00:02:19,03 --> 00:02:22,00
I understand you're thinking of having a baby.
我瞭解你們在考慮生寶寶的事

27
00:02:22,20 --> 00:02:26,14
I see you're nine months pregnant. That's a good start.
我知道你已懷胎九月 這是好的開始

28
00:02:26,81 --> 00:02:29,80
-How are your contractions? -I love them.
-收縮的情況如何? -我喜歡

29
00:02:30,01 --> 00:02:33,45
Each one's like a little party in my uterus.
每一陣都像是子宮中的小舞會

30
00:02:33,65 --> 00:02:37,91
-Every 4 minutes,lasting 55 seconds. -59 seconds. Quartz.
-每4分鐘,持續55秒 -59秒,石英表

31
00:02:38,92 --> 00:02:40,11
Swiss quartz.
瑞士石英表

32
00:02:42,42 --> 00:02:45,42
-Am I allowed to drink anything? -lce chips.
-我能喝飲料嗎? -碎冰

33
00:02:45,63 --> 00:02:48,15
-At the nurse's station. -I'll get it!
-護士站有 -我去拿

34
00:02:48,36 --> 00:02:51,13
-No,I'll get it. -No,I'm getting it.
-不,我去,馬上回來 -不,我去…

35
00:02:52,37 --> 00:02:55,73
Hi. Thought you might like some ice chips.
我想你或許想喝碎冰謝謝

36
00:02:56,34 --> 00:02:59,53
-Thanks. -And if you need anything else l...
-謝謝. -如果還需要別的…

37
00:02:59,74 --> 00:03:01,61
...do not believe we've met.
我沒見過吧?

38
00:03:03,18 --> 00:03:04,58
I'm Rachel Greene.
我叫瑞秋格林

39
00:03:04,85 --> 00:03:08,08
I'm Carol's ex-husband's sister's roommate.
卡蘿前任丈夫妹抹的室友

40
00:03:08,58 --> 00:03:11,02
Nice to meet you. I'm Dr. Franzblau.
幸會,我是法大夫

41
00:03:11,25 --> 00:03:16,05
I'm your roommate's brother's ex-wife's obstetrician.
你室友哥哥前妻的醫生

42
00:03:16,59 --> 00:03:18,18
Oh,that's funny.
真有趣

43
00:03:24,93 --> 00:03:27,09
I want a baby.
我要個寶寶

44
00:03:27,30 --> 00:03:30,74
Not tonight,honey. I got an early day tomorrow.
今晚不行,親愛的我明天得早起

45
00:03:30,94 --> 00:03:35,71
-Get up. Let's get some coffee. -Okay,because we never do that.
-起來,我們去買咖啡 -好吧,因為我們沒做過

46
00:03:36,95 --> 00:03:41,21
Shoot,shoot,shoot. Or just fall down. That's good too.
投.投.投.或是不進也行

47
00:03:42,22 --> 00:03:43,38
Knick fan?
尼克斯迷?

48
00:03:43,59 --> 00:03:47,85
-Oh,boy,do they suck. -Listen,lady
-他們爛透了 -聽著,女士

49
00:03:49,42 --> 00:03:51,76
Look. Look at your man,Ewing.
看,你的尤恩

50
00:03:51,96 --> 00:03:55,33
He couldn't hit water if he was standing on a boat.
他連坐在船上都投不進水裡

51
00:03:55,66 --> 00:03:58,13
-And who do you like? -Celtics.
-是嗎?你支持誰? -凱爾特人

52
00:03:58,33 --> 00:04:01,56
Celtics? They couldn't hit a boat if
凱爾特人?他們不可能擊中船隊的如果

53
00:04:01,80 --> 00:04:03,63
Wait....
等等

54
00:04:04,64 --> 00:04:06,73
They suck,all right?
反正他們很爛

55
00:04:07,08 --> 00:04:09,44
Shut up. It's a rebuilding year
閉嘴,今年是重建年

56
00:04:11,28 --> 00:04:14,94
Let me get the father. We need a father over here.
我幫你叫孩子的爹,我們這兒需要爸爸…

57
00:04:15,18 --> 00:04:17,01
There's no father.
這裡沒有爸爸

58
00:04:18,79 --> 00:04:22,92
-Oh,sorry. -That's okay. I'm fine.
-抱歉 -沒關係,我沒事

59
00:04:24,59 --> 00:04:26,36
Okay. Right this way.
這邊來

60
00:04:26,59 --> 00:04:30,43
All the other pregnant women seem to be going in here.
所有的孕婦似乎都往這兒走

61
00:04:36,54 --> 00:04:40,13
They're tiny and chubby And so sweet to touch
他們又小又肉摸起來感覺很好

62
00:04:40,38 --> 00:04:44,04
But soon they'll grow up And resent you so much
不久他們長大後就會開始恨你

63
00:04:45,98 --> 00:04:50,01
Now they're yelling at you And you don 't know why
現在他們對你大吼大叫,你不知原因為何

64
00:04:50,22 --> 00:04:54,15
And you cry and you cry And you cry
你只能哭啊,哭啊,你哭啊

65
00:04:54,36 --> 00:04:57,52
And you cry and you cry And you cry
你只能哭啊,哭啊,你哭啊

66
00:04:57,73 --> 00:05:01,06
-Thanks,Ross. -I'm paying you to stop.
-謝謝,羅斯 -用來叫你停止的好吧

67
00:05:03,36 --> 00:05:07,30
Oh,look,twins. Hi,guys. Oh,cute.
看,是雙胞胎,好可愛

68
00:05:08,57 --> 00:05:09,70
No fair.
不公平

69
00:05:09,90 --> 00:05:12,67
I don't even have one. How come they get two?
我一個都沒有,他們怎會有兩個?

70
00:05:12,87 --> 00:05:15,50
-You'll get one. -When?
-你也會有的 -什麼時候?

71
00:05:15,74 --> 00:05:20,68
Tell you what. When we're 40, if neither of us are married...
好吧,告訴你.我們40歲時如果都還單身

72
00:05:20,88 --> 00:05:22,78
...what do you say we have one?
我們就一起生一個,如何?

73
00:05:22,98 --> 00:05:26,04
Why won't I be married when I'm 40?
為何我40歲時還單身?

74
00:05:26,25 --> 00:05:28,15
I just meant hypothetically.
不,這只是假設

75
00:05:28,36 --> 00:05:32,42
Hypothetically,why won't I be married when I'm 40?
假設為何我到40歲時還單身?

76
00:05:32,93 --> 00:05:37,42
What is it? Is there something unmarriable about me?
為什麼?我有不適婚姻的毛病嗎?

77
00:05:38,27 --> 00:05:39,76
Well?
好吧?

78
00:05:40,03 --> 00:05:43,09
Dear God! This parachute is a knapsack.
親愛的上帝!這降落傘是個背包

79
00:05:47,61 --> 00:05:49,87
Look at you,dressy-dress.
看你,盛裝登場

80
00:05:50,28 --> 00:05:51,91
Did you go home and change?
你回家換衣服?

81
00:05:52,15 --> 00:05:55,81
It's an important day. I want to look nice.
今天是個重要的日子,我想漂亮一點

82
00:05:56,22 --> 00:05:58,28
Has Dr. Franzblau been by?
法大夫來了嗎?

83
00:05:59,82 --> 00:06:01,02
I haven't seen him.
不,我們還沒見到他

84
00:06:01,26 --> 00:06:03,95
Where is he? He is supposed to be here.
他在哪兒?他應該在這兒的

85
00:06:06,39 --> 00:06:08,29
What if the baby needs him?
萬一小孩需要他怎麼辦?

86
00:06:08,56 --> 00:06:12,97
What's the deal with you and doctors? Is your father a doctor?
瑞秋,你和醫生到底是怎麼了 難道你爸也是個醫生?

87
00:06:13,17 --> 00:06:14,43
Yeah. Why?
對,幹嘛問?

88
00:06:15,74 --> 00:06:17,17
No reason.
沒理由

89
00:06:18,91 --> 00:06:21,14
Mom,we've been through this.
媽媽,我們能過這個

90
00:06:21,34 --> 00:06:23,90
No,I am not calling him.
不,我不找他

91
00:06:24,18 --> 00:06:27,31
I don't care if it is his kid, the guy's a jerk.
我不管這是不是他的孩子,他是個大渾蛋

92
00:06:27,52 --> 00:06:31,08
No,I am not alone. Joey's here.
不,我不是一個人,喬伊在這兒

93
00:06:32,09 --> 00:06:33,82
What do you mean "Joey who"?
什麼意思?喬伊什麼?

94
00:06:34,09 --> 00:06:35,25
Joey who?
喬伊什麼?

95
00:06:35,52 --> 00:06:38,58
-Tribbiani. -Joey Tribbiani.
-崔比歐尼 -喬伊崔比歐尼

96
00:06:39,63 --> 00:06:43,62
Yes. Okay. Hold on.
對,等等

97
00:06:43,87 --> 00:06:45,92
She wants to talk to you.
她要跟你談

98
00:06:46,50 --> 00:06:47,99
Take the phone.
拿著電話

99
00:06:49,27 --> 00:06:50,67
Yeah,it's me.
對,是我

100
00:06:52,44 --> 00:06:54,50
No,we're just friends.
不,我們只是朋友

101
00:06:55,34 --> 00:06:56,94
Yeah,I'm single.
對,我單身

102
00:06:57,78 --> 00:06:59,04
Twenty-five.
25歲

103
00:06:59,71 --> 00:07:02,71
An actor. Hello?
演員

104
00:07:07,69 --> 00:07:10,21
She's not much of a phone person.
她不善於講電話

105
00:07:10,46 --> 00:07:14,12
So,what's the deal with this father guy?
孩子的爸怎麼了?

106
00:07:14,36 --> 00:07:18,23
If someone was having my baby, I'd wanna know about it.
如果有人即將生下我的孩子,我會想知道的

107
00:07:18,53 --> 00:07:23,53
Hey,Knick fan,am I interested in your views on fatherhood? No.
尼克斯迷,你對爸爸的觀點我不在乎

108
00:07:26,24 --> 00:07:29,33
-Maybe I should just go. -Maybe you should.
-或許吧我應該走了. -也許應該

109
00:07:29,58 --> 00:07:31,20
Good luck...
祝你好運

110
00:07:32,28 --> 00:07:34,11
...and take care.
保重了

111
00:07:40,52 --> 00:07:43,72
The Celtics problem is that the players run the team.
你知道凱爾特人有什麼問題? 他們讓球員經營球隊這不是真的

112
00:07:43,96 --> 00:07:47,09
-That is so not true. -Oh,it is.
-這不是真的 -這當然是真的

113
00:07:47,33 --> 00:07:49,16
-Breathe. -Breathe.
-深呼吸 -深呼吸

114
00:07:49,93 --> 00:07:51,59
You're gonna kill me.
你們會害死我的

115
00:07:52,10 --> 00:07:56,26
-Fifteen more seconds. 1 4,1 3,1 2 -Count faster.
-剩15秒 -14,13,12數快點

116
00:07:56,47 --> 00:08:00,41
It'll be okay. IKeep focusing on Jordy. He'll be here soon.
你會沒事,記得這樣做全是為了裘帝,他馬上就到了

117
00:08:00,61 --> 00:08:04,91
-Three. Two. Who the hell is Jordy? -Your son.
-3,2,1.裘帝到底是誰? -你兒子

118
00:08:05,11 --> 00:08:09,14
I don't have a son named Jordy. We all agreed on Jamie.
不,我不要我兒子叫裘帝, 我們協議過,我兒子叫潔米

119
00:08:09,35 --> 00:08:12,44
Jamie was the name of Susan's first girlfriend...
潔米是蘇珊第一任女友的名字

120
00:08:12,65 --> 00:08:14,64
...so we went back to Jordy.
所以我們決定還是用裘帝

121
00:08:15,06 --> 00:08:19,19
What do you mean,back to Jordy? We never landed on Jordy.
這是什麼意思?還是用裘帝, 我們根本沒討論過裘帝

122
00:08:19,39 --> 00:08:24,06
We just passed by it during the whole Jesse-Cody-Dillon fiasco.
我們討論過傑西科德迪倫時提到一下

123
00:08:24,57 --> 00:08:26,90
Ow! Leg cramp!
我腳抽筋

124
00:08:27,17 --> 00:08:29,50
-I got it. -I got it. I'm doing it.
-我明白了 -明白,我來處理

125
00:08:29,70 --> 00:08:32,04
You get to sleep with her. I get the cramps.
你和她睡覺,我來處理抽筋

126
00:08:32,24 --> 00:08:33,33
No,you don't.
你不行

127
00:08:33,54 --> 00:08:35,81
That is it. I want both of you out.
夠了,你們都給我出去

128
00:08:36,01 --> 00:08:37,50
-She started it. -He did.
-什麼?是她引起的… -他…

129
00:08:37,71 --> 00:08:40,98
I'm trying to get a person out of my body here...
我不管,我想生下小孩

130
00:08:41,18 --> 00:08:45,18
...and you're not making it any easier! Now go!
你們在這兒根本是愈幫愈忙

131
00:08:47,26 --> 00:08:49,09
-Thanks. -See what you did?
-謝謝 -看你幹了什麼?

132
00:08:49,32 --> 00:08:51,29
-Listen -Out!
-聽著 -出去!

133
00:08:53,33 --> 00:08:55,82
Breathe. Breathe.
深呼吸.深呼吸

134
00:09:02,34 --> 00:09:05,60
What is that? Something exploded.
怎麼了?有東西爆炸了

135
00:09:06,71 --> 00:09:10,17
-That's not the baby,is it? -Her water broke. Calm down.
-不是嬰兒 -她的羊水破了,冷靜點

136
00:09:10,38 --> 00:09:13,64
Water breaking? What do you mean? What's that?
羊水破了?你什麼意思?

137
00:09:13,88 --> 00:09:15,78
Breathe. Breathe.
深呼吸.深呼吸

138
00:09:17,89 --> 00:09:22,75
I'm okay. I'm okay. That's disgusting. I'm okay.
我很好,我很好,這樣真討厭,我很好

139
00:09:23,62 --> 00:09:26,92
-This is so your fault. -How is this my fault?
-這都是你的錯 -為什麼都是我的錯?

140
00:09:27,13 --> 00:09:30,50
Carol never threw me out of a room before you.
你們在一起之前卡蘿從未把我趕出房間

141
00:09:30,73 --> 00:09:34,29
There's a lot of things Carol never did before me.
我出現之前有許多事卡蘿沒做過

142
00:09:34,94 --> 00:09:39,27
-Are you trying to be clever? -You're so threatened by me.
-知道你的問題出在哪兒嗎? -你因我而感到岌岌可危

143
00:09:39,47 --> 00:09:43,57
Hey. Okay,all right. That's it. Get in here.
嘿,ok,好吧,就這樣,進去

144
00:09:43,78 --> 00:09:47,18
My God,you guys. I don't believe you.
天哪,夥計們,我簡直不敢相信你們兩個

145
00:09:47,45 --> 00:09:50,47
There are children coming into the world here...
小寶寶即將誕生在這棟建築

146
00:09:50,79 --> 00:09:54,24
...and your fighting isn't the first thing they should hear.
他聽見的第一個聲音不該是你們的吵鬧聲

147
00:09:54,49 --> 00:09:56,96
So stop all the yelling! Just stop it!
所以你們別再吵了

148
00:09:59,86 --> 00:10:04,49
Don't make me do this again! I don't like my voice like this!
對,蘇珊,別讓我再發一次脾氣 我不喜歡我自己這樣

149
00:10:08,70 --> 00:10:11,90
Who wants to hear something ironic?
誰想聽反諷的事?

150
00:10:16,01 --> 00:10:18,07
Are they here yet?
他們到了嗎?

151
00:10:18,31 --> 00:10:20,64
Don't worry, we're gonna find them.
不要擔心,我們會找到他們那的

152
00:10:20,85 --> 00:10:24,25
And until we do, we are all here for you. Okay?
找到人之前,我們都會在這兒陪你的

153
00:10:25,82 --> 00:10:29,22
You were telling me about Paris. It sounds wonderful.
你告訴我巴黎的事真棒

154
00:10:29,42 --> 00:10:34,02
There was this great little pastry shop right by my hotel
那家糕餅店就在我住的飯店隔壁

155
00:10:34,23 --> 00:10:36,39
There you go,dear.
加油,加油,親愛的

156
00:10:37,43 --> 00:10:41,06
-You find them? -Not in the gift shop or cafeteria....
-你找到他們啦? -不是在禮品店或者咖啡廳

